{"app":"spr-flow","version":3,"nodes":[{"id":"note","type":"info","position":{"x":-806,"y":-378},"data":{"title":"Filter designer","text":"Long-pass edge filter: T = 0 for 400–520 nm, T = 1 for 580–800 nm, TiO₂ (H) / SiO₂ (L) on BK7.\n\nPress Start in the Filter designer: it starts from a quarter-wave stack, inserts layers where the needle function says they help, adds layers by gradual evolution when the needles are exhausted, and refines all thicknesses (analytic gradients).\n\nOther types (AR, band-pass, notch, mirror) in the “type” menu; tick “thick substrate” to include the back face of the plate (or to design the back coating).","color":"#8a93a6","width":360,"height":280}},{"id":"air","type":"material","position":{"x":-806,"y":0},"data":{"materialId":"Air","color":"#f4f6fa","indexMode":"absolute","porosity":{"$num":"NaN"}}},{"id":"tio2","type":"material","position":{"x":-806,"y":212},"data":{"materialId":"TiO2","color":"#f2f0e6","indexMode":"absolute","porosity":{"$num":"NaN"}}},{"id":"sio2","type":"material","position":{"x":-806,"y":425},"data":{"materialId":"SiO2","color":"#cfe3ef","indexMode":"absolute","porosity":{"$num":"NaN"}}},{"id":"bk7","type":"material","position":{"x":-806,"y":637},"data":{"materialId":"BK7","color":"#9fc9e6","indexMode":"absolute","porosity":{"$num":"NaN"}}},{"id":"filter","type":"filter","position":{"x":-364,"y":-47},"data":{"name":"","preset":"longpass","bands":[{"lo":400,"hi":520,"q":"T","value":0,"weight":1},{"lo":580,"hi":800,"q":"T","value":1,"weight":1}],"lmin":400,"lmax":800,"step":5,"targetQ":"T","angles":"0","pol":"unpolarized","materials":2,"thick":false,"dSub":1,"sides":"front","minD":5,"maxD":1000,"maxLayers":40,"maxTotal":4000,"algorithm":"needle","iterations":30,"needleStep":5,"lambdaRef":460,"start":"qw","startPeriods":6,"startMat":0,"startD":100,"design":{"front":[],"back":[]},"merit":{"$num":"NaN"},"history":[]}},{"id":"wl","type":"param","position":{"x":416,"y":-236},"data":{"quantity":"lambda","mode":"range","va